          "sentences": [
            {
              "start": 4100,
              "end": 11800,
              "text": "Thanks for joining, Dana and Marcus. We want to walk through August and what we are changing."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speakerId": "6432345678555530101",
          "topic": "Incidents",
          "sentences": [
            {
              "start": 12500,
              "end": 21900,
              "text": "August was rough. Two outages, on the nineteenth and on the twenty-seventh."
            },
            {
              "start": 22100,
              "end": 30400,
              "text": "On the nineteenth we had trucks waiting on ETAs for three hours."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speakerId": "6432345678555530067",
          "topic": "Incidents",
          "sentences": [
            {
              "start": 31000,
              "end": 42200,
              "text": "I understand. Engineering added canary deploys and certificate monitoring, so both root causes are fixed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speakerId": "6432345678555530102",
          "topic": "Next Steps",
          "sentences": [
            {
              "start": 43000,
              "end": 46900,
              "text": "And what happens if it happens again?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speakerId": "6432345678555530067",
          "topic": "Next Steps",
          "sentences": [
            {
              "start": 47300,
              "end": 58800,
              "text": "If there is another tracking incident this quarter, I will make sure you get a service credit on your next invoice. That is a commitment from me."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speakerId": "6432345678555530101",
          "topic": "Contract",
          "sentences": [
            {
              "start": 59500,
              "end": 71200,
              "text": "A credit is fine, but our legal team is reviewing the SLA clause in the MSA. We may ask for more than a credit."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speakerId": "6432345678555530067",
          "topic": "Contract",
          "sentences": [
            {
              "start": 71800,
              "end": 83900,
              "text": "Understood. I cannot promise a refund on this call, but send us what legal finds and we will review it with RevOps."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speakerId": "6432345678555530068",
          "topic": "Contract",
          "sentences": [
            {
              "start": 84500,
              "end": 92300,
              "text": "For August, the standard SLA credit is ten percent of the monthly fee."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "callId": "7782342274025938011",
      "transcript": [
        {
          "speakerId": "6432345678555530201",
          "topic": "Pricing",
          "sentences": [
            {
              "start": 3200,
              "end": 15600,
              "text": "FleetGlass offered us a three-year deal at a much lower price. To renew with you we would need twenty-five percent off."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speakerId": "6432345678555530067",
          "topic": "Pricing",
          "sentences": [
            {
              "start": 16100,
              "end": 27400,
              "text": "Twenty-five percent is above what I can approve. Anything above twenty percent needs executive approval on our side."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speakerId": "6432345678555530201",
          "topic": "Next Steps",
          "sentences": [
            {
              "start": 28000,
              "end": 33900,
              "text": "How long will that take? Our renewal is on November thirtieth."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "speakerId": "6432345678555530067",
          "topic": "Next Steps",
          "sentences": [
            {
              "start": 34400,
              "end": 39100,
              "text": "You will have an answer within two weeks."
